  "title": "Savory Italian Sausage Sauce",
  "description": "This is a great homemade Italian sausage sauce. It's savory and spicy, as well as thick and chunky. The secret is the combination of Italian sausage, green onions, red wine, and red pepper flakes. Easily double or triple amounts and top on anything! Even better the next day.",
